From 831e7a1020848fbd714781e0cd55e70d4f88ccc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Petr Sumbera <sumbera@volny.cz>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 11:32:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Harden bitmap and MPPC parsing for issue #436

Address confirmed bounds, allocation and stream-lifetime defects discussed in https://github.com/rdesktop/rdesktop/issues/436.

Validate MPPC copy spans against the selected dictionary, constrain bitmap cache orders and primary bitmap payloads, check compressed input and planar row bounds, and preserve nullable stream offsets before realloc.

Retain the existing row-bounded UNROLL8 loops: the overwrite mechanisms in claims 3 and 4 were not established. Correct independently identified input and allocation defects without claiming five verified CVE fixes.

AI usage: local corrections generated with Codex; source review and validation AI-assisted.
Submitted upstream: https://github.com/rdesktop/rdesktop/pull/437
Source commit: https://github.com/psumbera/rdesktop/commit/831e7a1020848fbd714781e0cd55e70d4f88ccc4
Source: https://github.com/psumbera/rdesktop/commit/831e7a1020848fbd714781e0cd55e70d4f88ccc4
Not yet merged upstream.
Ported to marcofortina/rdesktop v1.9.1; the same bounds checks apply.
